&h=200&blur=200&s=898d21e68f3fe56df8283e1457fd831a 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, I'd like to make one request because I'm fascinated by illustrations of etiquette-crazed Pokémon girls.\nIn the latest Anipoke, there was a scene where Gou and Lucario sat on a Bacuda's hump and burned their butts, and I'd like a picture of this with Yuuri and Marie.\nFor reference, there's a picture of the scene on Pokelin's summary page, so you can check that page, or you can watch the scene at around 10:44 on youtube.\nThe picture is composed of two panels.\n1) The part where the two of them sit on the cob and their faces turn red. (Tresses are fine.)\n2) The part where they jump up with tears in their eyes because their butts are on fire. Please use an angle from behind, unlike the actual scene in the anime, to emphasize the buttocks that are now fully visible due to the burning skirt and pants. You may not be able to imagine the expression of the buttocks on fire, but there are many pictures of that situation in the tag \"fire on the buttocks in Shibu\", so please refer to it.\n\nIt's a comical scene, but I can't stop fantasizing about what it would be like if a girl's ass caught on fire, so this is a strange request, but please consider it.", "nc": 161, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@piito_illust/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 552254, "client_id": 31656, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce64fa9a378e7e1ee1619854a1ea8e86", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce64fa9a378e7e1ee1619854a1ea8e86, https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=99708dd606350162942824088bd4d959 2x, https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ce878aa08c7681c7217db72ebae23d53 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06f40249eca8d736f40b07471af87160", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06f40249eca8d736f40b07471af87160, https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33fc4366b77152f6ab225324471c5c33 2x, https://si.imgix.net/395acf53/uploads/origins/dcd072e0-925f-4c43-adeb-995b2fce7f9d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d6a73f3e22ad43222c835cb2c68a8b54 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして！\nキャラはポケモンBWの女主人公のトウコちゃんでバストアップでおっぱい(特に乳首と乳輪)に特化したのをお願いします！\n\nシチュエーションは「あまりの暑さで木陰で目のやり場に困るぐらい無防備な格好で休んでいるトウコちゃん」\n\n■初期の服装で原作より肌の露出が多い感じで。\n・上半身は白のタンクトップ(ノーブラ)のみで両方の肩紐がずり下がって肩と胸元が大きく露出してるくらい着崩れて上乳がほとんど見えちゃっている。\n・下のデニムのホットパンツは太ももが大きく露出してるくらい丈が短く鼠径部が見えてるくらいずり下がっている。\n・帽子は被っているがその他バックや黒の上着は地面に置いている。\n\n■雌に特化した極上の身体でお尻が大きく太ももがムチムチしてる。\n■おっぱいは頭より一回り以上大きい爆乳化。\n■ノーブラなのでどたぷんと開放された感じで重量感があり谷間が大きく強調されている。\n\n■乳輪の色は薄くてCDサイズ以上の下品なくらい巨大な乳輪。\n■パフィーニップルで乳輪がぷっくりと盛り上がっている。\n■両方の胸元から巨大な乳輪がはみ出て見えている。\n\n■ホルスタイン級のニプルファックができそうなくらい肉厚で極太の自己主張の激しい巨大な乳首。\n※この大きさと太さの乳首と乳輪と色→https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/86287932\n\n■片方のおっぱいは服越しから乳首と乳輪が透けて浮き上がって見えている。\n■もう片方のおっぱいは胸元から乳首がチラッと完全にポロリしていて勃起してる。\n■汗が肌や胸元に少量ついている。\n■片手で顔をパタパタとあおいでいるポーズ。\n■腕でおっぱいを隠さないようにお願いします。\n■本人は暑さで頬を赤くしてぼーっとしていてポロリしていることに全然気づいていない表情。\n\n細かい注文で大変申し訳ありませんがどうかご検討のほどよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 20103, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ナカムラナヲ。", "screen_name": "Tutihumaz77", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1823365687722827776/R-ZR8aQa.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/888597383906340865/1688828990/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "complete_expiration_days": 10, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 177}, {"id": 359249, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "羊太郎(仮)", "screen_name": "hitsuzi_taro11", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1883011257831501824/liOA5DTN.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2898306804/1719820273/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 14, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "nc": 32}, {"id": 653620, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "QR", "screen_name": "kataarmd", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1682357578846859267/a9hJZ-T9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/3190992588/1700102789/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 70, "skills":